"permission.explanation" = "It is used only to:\n• read the position and size of windows and of the Dock;\n• resize windows when the Dock moves to another display.\n\nNothing leaves your Mac. In System Settings › Privacy & Security › Accessibility, turn on “DynamicDockSpace”. The app notices the permission by itself — no restart needed.";
